  "findings": [
    "The raw prepared-root source producer derives local allocation, fork ownership, admission, close and release facts; no SourceScopeProducer or authorized read is assumed.",
    "actual_entry_acceptance is closed and inhabited. Its constructor retains one source tuple and the same process/capability/queue/journal/IO/scope history, actual source labels and exact public tick equality.",
    "The ordinary public consumer derives fixed native values on the same source-bound argument bytes. Exact full-frame facts, in addition to Tick equality, bind after descriptor maps.",
    "Clock byte loads were reproved from the copied bytes without whole-memory equality. All 58 affected theorem types are unchanged; only Axioms.proof_irr was removed.",
    "Unsafe/intercepted operations, foreign authority, failures and loss remain in the universal relations. Useful finite execution and finite-prefix safety do not assume termination.",
    "Prepared policy/root/identity/object and earlier ancestor producers remain assigned to authority; later supervision and public observation producers remain separately assigned."
  ],
